'' The control for darwin-rt-narrow-macos-arm64.test: off Apple a runtime call's narrow
'' argument is passed as before, plain i8 / i16, and nothing carries an extension attribute.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target linux-x86_64 --emit-ir tests/codegen/src/darwin-rt-narrow.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: declare void @"fb_PrintUByte"(i32, i8, i32)
'' EXPECT-OUT: declare void @"fb_PrintShort"(i32, i16, i32)
'' EXPECT-OUT: declare i16 @"fb_CVSHORT"(ptr)
'' EXPECT-NOT: zeroext
'' EXPECT-NOT: signext
